xiexi-ws2413335"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001","text":"劉琨，字越石，中山魏昌人，漢中山靖王勝之後也。祖邁，有經國之才，爲相國參軍、散騎常侍。父蕃，清高沖儉，位至光祿大夫。琨少得俊朗之目，與范陽祖納俱以雄豪著名。年二十六，爲司隸從事。時征虜將軍石崇河南金谷澗中有別廬，冠絕時輩，引致賓客，日以賦詩。琨預其間，文詠頗爲當時所許。秘書監賈謐參管朝政，京師人士無不傾心。石崇、歐陽建、陸機、陸雲之徒，並以文才降節事謐，琨兄弟亦在其間，號曰「二十四友」。太尉高密王泰辟爲掾，頻遷著作郎、太學博士、尚書郎。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":12,"last_line":12,"raw_start":262,"raw_end":488,"raw_character_offsets":[264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336,337,338,339,340,341,342,343,344,345,346,347,348,349,350,351,352,353,354,355,356,357,358,359,360,361,362,365,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378,379,380,381,382,383,384,385,386,387,388,389,390,391,392,393,394,395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411,412,413,414,415,416,417,418,419,420,421,422,423,424,425,426,427,428,429,430,431,432,433,434,435,436,437,438,439,440,441,442,443,444,445,446,447,448,449,450,451,452,453,454,455,456,457,458,459,460,461,462,463,464,465,466,467,468,469,470,471,472,473,474,475,476,477,478,479,480,481,482,483,484,485,486,487],"revision_id":2629226},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001:m0000","surface":"劉琨","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001:m0004","surface":"越石","start":4,"end":6,"person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001:m0014","surface":"中山靖王勝","start":14,"end":19,"person_id":"hwb_e0m_is8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001:m0024","surface":"邁","start":24,"end":25,"person_id":"3oq_dy4_3iu","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p001:m